  {
   "id": 5,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Flipzeit (je Flip)",
   "description": "Nutzersicht (01.10.): P→D = P-Ende -> erstes Decode auf D (Rang-Segmente), D→P = Decode-Ende -> P-Prefill-Start (flip_user_time); Teile part=warmup|layer|nachlauf|d_extend. Ein Punkt je Flip zum flip_begin; Leerlauf-Flips ohne Wert.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "vm"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 9,
    "w": 12,
    "h": 8
   },
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s",
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "points",
      "lineWidth": 0,
      "fillOpacity": 12,
      "pointSize": 6,
      "showPoints": "always",
      "spanNulls": false,
      "stacking": {
       "mode": "none"
      }
